================================================================================
NOT REDISTRIBUTED — RUNTIME DEPENDENCY, LISTED AS A WARNING
================================================================================

Amazon Location Service traffic tiles carry HERE content, sublicensed via AWS,
with MANDATORY attribution "(c) 2026 HERE" and NO redistribution grant. No HERE
data is contained in this repository. The adapter that reads it is, and
config/sources.json records redistributable: false. The WZDx projection now
reads that flag and excludes non-redistributable or unconfirmed contributors, so
HERE-derived work zones do not leave through /wzdx. The general query API still
serializes canonical events without a licence filter, so a deployment that sets
publicQueryApi=true can still republish HERE-derived records through /events.
Resolve that before pointing a public consumer at the query API. See README.md
and config/sources.json.
